ent":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"WKj8m9bylgM","position":33,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Missy Elliott - Pass The Dutch (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"Cp5VzxNpw0I","path":"/artists/missy-elliott/tracks/pass-the-dutch-instrumental/","slug":"pass-the-dutch-instrumental","title":"Pass The Dutch (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"missy-elliott","title":"Missy Elliott"},"artwork":"images/artists/missy-elliott/tracks/pass-the-dutch-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"UMjXwUAv27s","slug":"148","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-148"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #148","artwork":"/images/episodes/148.jpg","content":"\nContinuing Joe Kay's 24th birthday celibration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nIn celebration of Joe's 24th birthday yesterday, we started celebrating on Thursday at The Sound of Tomorrow (The Crosby) with Astronautica & starRo! Thank you to everyone who came out and supported, what a show it was. This radio session is just a continuation of the celebration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard. \nBless to those who tuned into the live broadcast via Kbeach. It's amazing to think about how far we've came. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10830,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"0ZN6d4nqULA","position":32,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Missy Elliott - The Rain (Supa Dupa Fly)","track":{"id":"Du2oUxNvJ54","path":"/artists/missy-elliott/tracks/the-rain-supa-dupa-fly/","slug":"the-rain-supa-dupa-fly","title":"The Rain (Supa Dupa Fly)","artist":{"slug":"missy-elliott","title":"Missy Elliott"},"artwork":"images/artists/missy-elliott/tracks/the-rain-supa-dupa-fly.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"nbke6-Mfddk","slug":"161","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-161"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #161","artwork":"/images/episodes/161.jpg","content":"Joe focuses on new tracks from forthcoming Soulection releases.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJoe also announced some hints about what to expect in the coming months. We have so much in store for you. \nWe're only a couple of weeks in to the new year and already we feel like we have hit some milestones. \n\nStay tuned. \n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10868,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"vBkYIvKGg68","position":46,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Missy Elliott - Sock It 2 Me (Kaytranada Remix)","track":{"id":"aJaXUvMmdVQ","path":"/artists/missy-elliott/tracks/sock-it-2-me-kaytranada-remix/","slug":"sock-it-2-me-kaytranada-remix","title":"Sock It 2 Me (Kaytranada Remix)","artist":{"slug":"missy-elliott","title":"Missy Elliott"},"artwork":"images/artists/missy-elliott/tracks/sock-it-2-me-kaytranada-remix.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"H72dT7S3xco","slug":"205","tags":[7,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https